    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just a \"bad phase\" though. it's like the spark is permanently gone. i feel like i'm just taking up air that someone more talented, someone more \"alive,\" could be using. it's exhausting pretending to be a person with a purpose when i know i'm just a hollowed out version of what i used to be.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
    {
