      "content": "I can hear that you're feeling incredibly low and disheartened, and it's okay to acknowledge these feelings. It's crucial to remember that everyone has moments of struggle, and it's more than okay to seek help during tough times. A mental health professional, such as a therapist, can provide you the space and tools to explore these feelings further and work through them. You're not alone, and there are people who care and want to help you get through this.",
      "source": "target",
